  "text": "Claude, Claude Code, Cursor, ChatGPT, Gemini, Windsurf, Copilot, Lovable, v0, Bolt, Google Chrome and other names are trademarks of their owners. Huescribe isn’t affiliated with or endorsed by any of them."
 },
 {
  "id": "f3e625fc75",
